= People

== Group Members

~~~
{}{img_left}{images/ye.jpg}{Dr. Xiuzhen Ye}{130}{130}{}
*Dr. Xiuzhen Ye* [https://www.linkedin.com/in/xiuzhen-ye-443a52330/ \[LinkedIn\]] \n
Postdoctoral Scholar (since October 2024) \n
Education: Ph.D. Electrical Engineering, University of Sheffield (2023), advised by Iñaki Esnaola, thesis: Sparsity and Coordination Constraints on Stealth Data Injection Attacks; M.Sc. Electrical Engineering, South China University of Technology (2019), advised by Tianyao Ji; B.S. Smart Grid Information Engineering, Nanjing University of Posts and Telecommunications (2016). \n
Research: Data-driven observation and control using operator theory; control with safety and security concerns. \n
Hobbies: Born in Fujian, China, Xiuzhen enjoys exploring new things both in science and daily life. Chinese dancing and physical exercise have been her long-term hobbies since young; she was a dancer in her school's art troupe and a member of the university badminton team. Recently, she has developed interests in bouldering and control theory.
~~~

